    "chunk_text": "First Capital Holdings donates Rs. 15 m to \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 fund\n\nFirst Capital Holdings PLC recently donated Rs. 15 million to the \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 fund, established to provide relief to communities affected by the cyclone Ditwah.\n\nThe cheque was presented by First Capital Holdings PLC Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer Dilshan Weerasekara to Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake at the Presidential Secretariat.\n\nFirst Capital Holdings PLC Board of Directors Randinith Madanayake and Diluni Dhanushika were also present at the occasion."
